---
import { ShieldCheck, Award, BookOpen, ExternalLink } from "lucide-react";
import { SEO_BIO } from "../../data-seo";
import LetterGlitch from "../react/LetterGlitch.tsx";
---

<section id="about" class="border-t border-brand-800/30 pt-16">
  <div class="grid grid-cols-1 lg:grid-cols-12 gap-12">
    <div class="lg:col-span-4 flex flex-col h-full">
      <div class="space-y-4">
        <span class="text-xs font-mono text-sky-400 uppercase tracking-widest block mb-2">01. Origin & Intent</span>
        <h2 class="font-display font-medium text-3xl text-slate-100 tracking-tight">The Data-Driven Approach To Growth</h2>
        <p class="text-xs text-slate-400 font-sans leading-relaxed italic border-l-2 border-sky-400/30 pl-3">
          "In a search economy reshaped by core updates and AI-generated answers, sustainable rankings are engineered from verified expertise, first-hand experience, and measurable data — never shortcuts."
        </p>
      </div>
      <div class="relative flex-1 min-h-30 mt-6">
        <div class="absolute inset-0 z-0 overflow-hidden rounded-xl" aria-hidden="true">
          <LetterGlitch
            glitchColors={["#38bdf8", "#818cf8", "#34d399", "#0ea5e9"]}
            glitchSpeed={50}
            smooth={true}
            outerVignette={true}
            client:visible
          />
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="lg:col-span-8 space-y-6 text-slate-400 text-sm leading-relaxed font-sans">
      <p>
        My journey in SEO began in <strong>{SEO_BIO.experienceSince}</strong> with small regional projects, but within
        a couple of years I moved to the international stage — launching promotion strategies for major e-commerce
        platforms and SaaS products across <strong>European and US markets</strong>. Today, as CEO &amp; Head of Strategy at
        <strong>Finial SEO</strong>, I am responsible for the agency's strategic direction, methodology development, and
        quality control across all projects.
      </p>
      <p>
        My philosophy is built on three principles: <strong>strategy before tactics</strong>, <strong>data instead of
        guesswork</strong>, and <strong>constant adaptation</strong> to algorithm changes. I treat SEO not as a set of technical
        tricks but as a full-fledged marketing discipline that must be integrated into the company's overall business
        strategy — with KPI tied to revenue, not vanity metrics.
      </p>
      <p>
        I place special emphasis on the <strong>E-E-A-T methodology</strong> (Experience, Expertise, Authoritativeness,
        Trustworthiness). I developed my own content audit system that assesses a site's expert potential and builds a
        strategy to enhance it — this approach became the foundation of many successful cases, including the recovery of
        Apex Online Pharmacy after a Google Core Update.
      </p>
      <a href="#case-studies" class="block mt-2 text-sky-400 hover:text-sky-300 underline font-mono text-xs">
        recovery of Apex Online Pharmacy
      </a>
      <p>
        In my free time I study behavioral economics and game theory, which helps me better understand user scenarios
        and predict trends in search behavior. I regularly speak at industry conferences and share my experience in an
        author column on VC.ru.
      </p>
      <p>
        I maintain a dual practice: alongside SEO strategy I work as an independent <strong>DeFi analyst</strong> and
        protocol auditor. Explore the quantitative side of my work on the DeFi Analyst Profile.
      </p>
      <a href="/" class="block mt-2 text-sky-400 hover:text-sky-300 underline font-mono text-xs">
        DeFi Analyst Profile
      </a>

      <div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-2 gap-6 mt-8 pt-8 border-t border-[#1e293b]/40">
        <div class="bg-[#0b101d]/60 border border-[#1e293b]/50 p-6 rounded-xl space-y-3 hover:border-sky-500/10 transition-colors">
          <div class="flex items-center gap-2 text-sky-400">
            <Award className="w-4 h-4" />
            <span class="text-xs font-mono uppercase tracking-wider font-semibold">Executive Mandate</span>
          </div>
          <h3 class="font-display font-medium text-slate-200 text-sm">CEO &amp; Head of Strategy @ {SEO_BIO.org}</h3>
          <p class="text-[11px] text-indigo-300 font-mono font-medium">Founded 2026 · Boutique Model</p>
          <p class="text-xs text-slate-400 font-sans leading-relaxed">
            Every project is led directly by the founders — no juniors, no ticket queues. Limited number of concurrent
            projects and full client access to analytics.
          </p>
          <div class="pt-2">
            <a href="https://finialseo.org/about/Maksim-Sokol" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="inline-flex items-center gap-1 text-[10px] font-mono text-sky-400 hover:text-sky-300 transition-colors">
              <span>Verify Agency Profile</span>
              <ExternalLink className="w-3 h-3" />
            </a>
          </div>
        </div>

        <div class="bg-[#0b101d]/60 border border-[#1e293b]/50 p-6 rounded-xl space-y-3 hover:border-indigo-500/10 transition-colors">
          <div class="flex items-center gap-2 text-indigo-400">
            <BookOpen className="w-4 h-4" />
            <span class="text-xs font-mono uppercase tracking-wider font-semibold">E-E-A-T Methodology</span>
          </div>
          <h3 class="font-display font-medium text-slate-200 text-sm">Proprietary Content Audit System</h3>
          <p class="text-[11px] text-indigo-300 font-mono font-medium">Experience · Expertise · Authority · Trust</p>
          <p class="text-xs text-slate-400 font-sans leading-relaxed">
            A systematic framework for assessing a site's expert potential and engineering it upward — from author
            entity graphs to first-hand experience layers and fact-checking pipelines.
          </p>
          <div class="pt-2">
            <a href="https://finialseo.org/methodology" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="inline-flex items-center gap-1 text-[10px] font-mono text-indigo-400 hover:text-indigo-300 transition-colors">
              <span>Publishing Principles</span>
              <ExternalLink className="w-3 h-3" />
            </a>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="bg-[#0f172a]/40 border border-[#1e293b]/50 p-6 rounded-xl mt-6 space-y-3 hover:border-emerald-500/10 transition-colors">
        <div class="flex items-center justify-between">
          <div class="flex items-center gap-2 text-emerald-400">
            <ShieldCheck className="w-4 h-4" />
            <span class="text-xs font-mono uppercase tracking-wider font-semibold">Strategy Service Catalogue</span>
          </div>
          <span class="text-[9px] font-mono text-emerald-400 bg-emerald-500/5 px-2 py-0.5 rounded border border-emerald-500/10">Active Offering</span>
        </div>
        <h4 class="font-display font-medium text-slate-200 text-sm">Full-Cycle SEO Strategy &amp; E-E-A-T Consulting</h4>
        <div class="grid grid-cols-2 gap-4 py-1 font-mono text-[9px] text-slate-400">
          <div>
            <span class="block text-slate-500 uppercase">Service Category</span>
            <span class="text-slate-200 font-semibold">Organic Growth Strategy</span>
          </div>
          <div>
            <span class="block text-slate-500 uppercase">Coverage Region</span>
            <span class="text-slate-200 font-semibold">{SEO_BIO.location}</span>
          </div>
        </div>
        <p class="text-xs text-slate-400 font-sans leading-relaxed">
          Comprehensive promotion strategies with predictable KPIs: technical audit, semantic architecture, E-E-A-T
          content systems, white outreach, and end-to-end ROI dashboards.
        </p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
